The test vehicle travels at target speed V1 on a straight road section. A target vehicle TV2 is positioned ahead of the test vehicle, traveling along the centerline of the lane at speed V2. A stationary target vehicle TV3 is placed ahead of target vehicle TV2. Target vehicle TV2 changes lanes to the adjacent lane at a lane-change cycle t. After completing the lane change, target vehicle TV2 continues traveling along the centerline of the adjacent lane. The time required for the test vehicle to reach the collision point is identical to the time required for target vehicle TV3 to reach the collision point.